draw_text_ext(x,y,"And with that Jumping Jones completed his mission. Who knows where our Hero will go next? Maybe he'll go relax on a beach. Maybe he'll be at home waiting for his game dev teacher to give him a A Plus. Who knows. All we do know is that Jumping Jones has done it again!",100, 700);


